    "title": "Knox Central holds off upset bid by Lady Bears in season opener - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By John Henson ,\n14 hours ago BARBOURVILLE —Going up against a team that beat them by an average of 34 points in two meetings a season ago, the Harlan County Lady Bears showed Tuesday they may be growing up. Harlan County led by as many as six points in the fourth quarter at Knox Central against a Lady Panthers’ squad that advanced to last year’s 13th Region Tournament final four and enters this season ranked third. The Lady Bears were still up by two with less than two minutes left before Knox reeled off nine unanswered points on the way to a 67-62 win. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
